Yuzic ALAC decoder

This app bundles FFmpeg 9.0.2 (libavcodec and libavutil, ALAC decoder enabled),
Copyright (c) 2000-2026 the FFmpeg developers, under LGPL version 2.1 or later.
See COPYING.LGPLv2.1 and FFmpeg-LICENSE.md in this directory.

Unmodified corresponding FFmpeg source:
https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-9.0.2.tar.xz
SHA-256: 8c3850283eb25fa026482078a04051e0be17347b09ef81a0849bec15a96e002e

The build configuration and JNI wrapper are distributed in yuzic-engine under
android/src/main/cpp, with rebuilding instructions in android/README.md:
https://github.com/yuzicapp/yuzic-engine

FFmpeg is built without GPL, nonfree, or version3 components. No FFmpeg network
transport, demuxer, encoder, or command-line program is enabled. It is linked
into libyuzic_alac.so. You may rebuild and replace that library in this app;
reverse engineering for debugging modifications to it is permitted.
